    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "Mexico is a country, and its people are called Mexicans. If you wanted to buy food there you would have to use their currency, which is the peso. Mexico has yummy desserts such as bionico. Bionico is made from several ingredients including sour cream, and it can be found in Guadalajara as well as Mexico. If you don\u2019t like bionico, you can go for a sandesh, another dessert."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "Sandesh is a confectionary dessert, much like Bionico, which is a dessert made with sour cream from the Guadalajara region in Mexico. Mexico uses the peso as its currency and is home to Mexicans."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "The peso is the currency of Mexico, the country inhabited by Mexicans. Mexico has a bionico usually served at the dessert course; this dish includes sour cream as an ingredient and comes from Guadalajara. Sandesh can be also served for dessert."
        }
    },
